  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Ta kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 qua c\u1EA7u, kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\xE1nh \u0111\u1ECBch.
      Nh\u01B0ng ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1EA1ng anh em. "
    - "\u0110inh \u0110i\u1EC1n, ng\u01B0\u01A1i d\u1EABn qu\xE2n cung th\u1EE7 l\xEAn
      cao, b\u1EAFn y\u1EC3m h\u1ED9. L\xFD Kh\xE1nh, ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\u1EA1o h\xE0ng
      khi\xEAn ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 quay m\u1EB7t ra s\xF4ng. To\xE0n qu\xE2n r\xFAt
      lui c\xF3 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa \u0111\xF4ng nam!"
